[{"title":"步陈泮渔夫子原韵","author":"陈宗赋","text":"秦政苛残此更兼，归与定省懒开帘。\n问天剋日机谁转，避地经年叹久淹。\n岁晚松筠坚自守，门多桃李盛何嫌。\n淡中滋味殊难得，从古和羹岂外盐。\n叨陪鲤对学庭趋，一字师资当一珠。\n家有含饴期子述，廪无继粟忍庚呼。\n唐诗雅爱吟风杜，汉节坚持嚼雪苏。\n乐育寿宁门下士，斯文能不在兹乎。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":491,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"即景感怀构成七律录呈陈泮渔夫子","author":"陈宗赋","text":"离乡去井景凄凉，鹭岛侨居暗自伤。\n亲近九旬亏子职，家无一物贮奚囊。\n首阳凭吊空流涕，伯道追维枉断肠。\n但愿秋风消息好，扫平倭寇快归航。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":492,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄陈培三王铭臣两茂才","author":"陈宗赋","text":"一闻消息最堪怜，附骥风流醉数年。\n只望探花推巨手，还思舞柳倚齐肩。\n未成儒雅歌诗债，几费君家买笑钱。\n倘得攀龙他日展，夺标归后续前缘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":493,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"丁酉1897秋闱步林仲衡游鼓山原韵","author":"陈宗赋","text":"鼓山闽峤最危巅，几欲登临竟不然。\n历尽风霜无避地，望施云雨可回天。\n关心松柏坚多节，转瞬桑田已变迁。\n试罢归期原未定，平安两字篆香烟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":494,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题陶村诗稿","author":"陈懋烈","text":"一卷新诗百感生，经年避寇赋长征。\n壮怀不作偷安计，又向桃源起义兵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":495,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题陶村诗稿","author":"陈懋烈","text":"数载书生戎马间，杜陵史笔寄瀛寰。\n采风若选东征集，咄咄吟中见一斑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":496,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题陶村诗稿","author":"陈懋烈","text":"浣花溪畔少陵祠，绝代诗才赋乱离。\n谁料千年才更出，有人继和北征诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":497,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"肖岩草堂自咏","author":"傅于天","text":"青山孤隐士，耕读甲溪边。\n左右双腰水，东西两面田。\n松梅于眷属，诗酒是因缘。\n屋小堪容膝，墙低只及肩。\n桑麻为乐事，车马谢喧填。\n写字妻磨墨，烹茶弟汲泉。\n牛归红树外，瓜摘绿棚前。\n父子家人趣，无怀亦葛天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":498,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"摘汝修原韵酬和","author":"傅于天","text":"屈指年华换，春来忽赠诗。\n连宵惊夜雨，竟夕觅晴丝。\n寓目诗千卷，舒怀笔一枝。\n灵机畴拮抗，典奥溯源支。\n集读淮南子，楷摹晋献之。\n闻鸡思起舞，拔剑斫生悲。\n道谊堪砭世，农桑爱及时。\n人言皆不间，孝弟两无亏。\n屋绕撑天树，园栽向日葵。\n临歧才握别，异地又相思。\n岂是焦桐爨，偏蒙戴笛吹。\n前身明月似，心与古人期。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":499,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"再叠辛巳1869夏日偕邱诰臣同子仙根并吕大汝玉汝修汝成林秋衡游竹溪寺用七十二峰羁客韵","author":"傅于天","text":"天公容我懒残身，评酒敲诗为禊辰。\n话到梅花空色相，修来明月认前因。\n风流自昔归才子，韵事何须逊古人。\n记取湘东三品在，一枝金管一枝银。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":500,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"竹溪寺","author":"傅于天","text":"两水回环绕曲溪，小南门外小桥西。\n群宾毕集疑金马，一佛忘机似木鸡。\n禅室香分炉篆起，琼瓯雪漾茗旗齐。\n归来好共黄生说，几个清蝉抱树啼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":501,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"法华寺","author":"傅于天","text":"吊古情深最可怜，重游胜地集群贤。\n现身莫问庄生事，蝴蝶依依似昔年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":502,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鸡冠花","author":"傅于天","text":"霜雪频经过岁华，芬芳浓艳胜诸花。\n娇红谁说无多子，似汝娇红子倍加。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":503,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赠仙根","author":"傅于天","text":"寿母堂前列绮筵，何人一曲压群仙。\n个中信有华岩子，射出文光焕碧天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":504,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"忆吕大汝玉","author":"傅于天","text":"春树暮云路几叉，其邻洽比若天涯。\n门前静听尨声吠，喜报君书又到家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":505,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"呈吕二汝修","author":"傅于天","text":"迩来万念扫俱空，卧看烟云跌荡中。\n蕉叶有心唯捲雨，柳枝无力祇随风。\n词成党锢分黄白，调写迎春砌绿红。\n每学閒鸥欲伸颈，愧惭小技类雕虫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":506,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"初冬漫兴","author":"傅于天","text":"犬吠疏篱客到门，诗成脱稿又黄昏。\n花能解语迎人笑，风亦知书把卷翻。\n叶未经霜浓不淡，炉须下火冷才温。\n痴儿也晓閒思饮，报说床头酒一樽。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":507,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"筱云轩","author":"傅于天","text":"人言邺架染芸香，我到君家兴更长。\n不是野王经作室，何来典籍满山房。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":508,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"留宋五采亭不住","author":"傅于天","text":"搜出银牌字几行，为儿祷祝注生娘。\n留君午饭匆匆去，那有閒心话草堂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":509,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"纸鸢","author":"傅于天","text":"不有丝纶系，何施巧妙工。\n思量千尺线，专候一天风。\n短调催残碧，新腔和晚红。\n飞来城郭外，吹入画图中。\n凤管鸾笙□，鹏抟鹤舞同。\n是谁穿乙乙，相望转濛濛。\n天末宫商发，郊原笑语通。\n高飘真在握，顾盼也豪雄。","collection":"清","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":510,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题吴鸿业百蝶图","author":"黄炳发","text":"久欲携宾宴醉乡，今朝何幸遇滕王。\n祗将妙笔传金粉，俨到南园绿草场。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":511,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题吴鸿业百蝶图","author":"黄清","text":"画里香魂梦里身，六朝金粉悟前因。\n披图恰好留真相，知是探花第一人。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":512,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过关渡港","author":"黄敬","text":"一望青山近，微濛不见家。\n只因归思急，那怕浪淘沙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":513,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋社竹枝词 其一","author":"黄敬","text":"相逢相问属秋天，共说今年胜旧年。\n田祖有神宜报赛，吹箫击鼓备芳筵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":514,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋社竹枝词 其二","author":"黄敬","text":"盘有粢兮鼎有牲，同来祀社告西成。\n祭馀不用留神惠，相劝庄人酒共倾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":515,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋社竹枝词 其三","author":"黄敬","text":"酒酣耳热歌声起，翘首村村夕照微。\n散社忍教相别去，醉闻箫管又忘归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":516,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台阳笔记题词","author":"叶芬","text":"卅载台阳记，千秋吏治关。\n运筹经口岸，持论抵眉山。\n壮志凌烟上，儒臣赋槊间。\n去思碑并读，应望使车还。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":517,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台阳笔记题词 其一","author":"管绳莱","text":"海色天风路渺茫，蛮云犵鸟自成乡。\n从今不读舆图记，一管生花写大荒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":518,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台阳笔记题词 其二","author":"管绳莱","text":"蛋雨闽风四十秋，潜蛟宫室蜃中楼。\n知君碧眼过犀烛，不学词人记十洲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":519,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台阳笔记题词","author":"刘辉","text":"海外归来解战袍，南游到处任逍遥。\n临风快读琳琅句，棠荫争传德政高。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":520,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"酬陈瑞陔贡士浚芝书怀索和。","author":"郑如兰","text":"绿章连日乞春阴，为护名花小院深。\n击钵有声皆戛玉，投囊无句不堆金。\n湖山千里供舒啸，风月双清助朗吟。\n坡老肚皮何处合，肯招时辈共谈心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":521,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿七言截句 其一","author":"郑廷理","text":"洛邑阴阳和气充，地灵人杰古今同。\n名区旧有耆英会，八十翁偕七十翁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":522,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿七言截句 其二","author":"郑廷理","text":"弱龄文采自翩翩，品擅蟾宫第一仙。\n转瞬韶光周甲子，是君重宴鹿鸣年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":523,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿七言截句 其三","author":"郑廷理","text":"恩周为士与为农，苃憩芳踪喜得逢。\n欲把甘棠比松柏，岁寒常晤召公容。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":524,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿七言截句 其四","author":"郑廷理","text":"单父琴弦欲不弹，莼鲈既得如加餐。\n采芝定入商山谷，四皓衣冠画里看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":525,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"留园雅集席上即事","author":"郑鹏云","text":"东望瀛壖泪眼哀，骚坛韵事话文开。\n名园宴会群英集，料有新诗继福台。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":526,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和周亦香广文赠句原韵","author":"郑鹏云","text":"诗成珠玉句惊奇，别馆清樽唱和时。\n衣带鲲洋唯一水，春潮有信负归期。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":527,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"入横山沿途即景二首之ㄧ","author":"赖世英","text":"奇峰形兀突，怪石状嶙峋。\n谷暗疑藏魅，禽鸣若唤人。\n萝藤垂栈道，莓藓绣荒津。\n世味尝甘苦，方知姜桂辛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":528,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"入横山沿途即景 其二","author":"赖世英","text":"逼仄羊肠险，崎岖鸟道赊。\n溪深桥独木，泥滑径三叉。\n露重滋新笋，林深噪暮鸦。\n昂头行且住，犬吠有人家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":529,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"有感","author":"赖世观","text":"世衰已道微，风俗自今非。\n郁郁向谁诉，斯民叹靡依。\n避秦复无地，惆怅焉所归。\n徙倚西城下，孤踪吊落晖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":530,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚游西郊 其一","author":"赖世观","text":"晚村绿竹自萧疏，犬吠声中野老居。\n一笑相逢曾识面，谁知托迹半樵渔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":531,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚游西郊 其二","author":"赖世观","text":"夕阳西坠半孤村，鸟语声中树色翻。\n牧子横牛吹短笛，閒来坐看菜花园。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":532,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"晚游西郊 其三","author":"赖世观","text":"园中种植地瓜多，野菜青青暮色过。\n地在城西三里外，茅庐聚首乐行窝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":533,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"台阳笔记题词","author":"钱之鼎","text":"鳀壑横云蛋海烟，双门高削护沙田。\n乘风少壮功名事，曾在扶桑万里天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":534,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿 其一 七言截句","author":"戴祥云","text":"当年妙手步云时，析得桂林第一枝。\n出宰闽中蚕绩著，三山旧尹万家思。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":535,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿 其二 七言截句","author":"戴祥云","text":"笙歌鼎沸九霞觞，化雨春风五载长。\n一念清操玉比洁，口碑载道永难忘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":536,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿 其三 七言截句","author":"戴祥云","text":"甘棠荫被入人深，塾课观风振士林。\n如此栽培桃李树，淡江到处绿成阴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":537,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿 其四 七言截句","author":"戴祥云","text":"洛邑耆英队里仙，我公继起胜当年。\n欣逢岳降崧生日，遥作诗歌庆寿筵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":538,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送吴生往东宁","author":"谢声鹤","text":"吴生手携一囊书，步行别我九鲤湖。\n嗟哉吴生何好游，扁舟欲上红毛楼。\n君不闻厦门七更到澎口，天风喷潮如雷吼。\n幽灵秘怪争呈奇，撑持银屋满江走。\n柁师到此亦改颜，阳侯弄舟如跳丸。\n侧柁欹帆入鹿耳，舟人始得庆平安。\n吴生胡为亦踏此，问之不答祗长叹。\n吴生吴生不须叹，世途何处不波澜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":539,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿 其一","author":"苏衮荣","text":"何年生甫诞维崧，阖邑趋尘拜下风。\n案牍判馀神最暇，金银气识眼能空。\n琴鸣善治饶供职，馆辟翘才亦养蒙。\n为计行旌初至日，欢声一一已呼嵩。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":540,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿 其二","author":"苏衮荣","text":"神君飞舄乍鸣驺，小范胸兵克壮猷。\n团练使民皆有勇，戈袍为我赋同仇。\n鱼来入釜驱三面，雀亦飘翎遍一州。\n张弛只知持国体，独醒不肯笑时流。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":541,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿 其三","author":"苏衮荣","text":"斯民何幸使君来，两袖风清济世才。\n疾苦输情佥志协，闾阎生计上心栽。\n鸿都经示童蒙告，鸡斗衅清鼠雀猜。\n陶冶能将群类铸，南山佳气满蓬莱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":542,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿 其四","author":"苏衮荣","text":"讲席斯文课切磋，肯因小邑废弦歌。\n新成试院觚初破，自是虚堂鉴不磨。\n哕却鸾旂丝竹奏，输将鹤俸鼓钟和。\n奎声辉映弧星朗，到处葵忱听玉珂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":543,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿 其五","author":"苏衮荣","text":"五载铜章此绾符，神仙风度解双凫。\n公堂鉴影金悬镜，止水盟心玉在壶。\n鞅掌几层劳抚字，折腰独不假驰驱。\n千秋寿祝修佳传，循吏将来是循儒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":544,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"曹仁宪谨荣寿 其六","author":"苏衮荣","text":"洛阳自昔会耆英，閒气又钟大雅生。\n丹壑趋庭诗礼教，紫陵晋爵梓桑荣。\n宦乡无奈思鲈脍，舆望殊深称兕觥。\n介寿跻堂登夏校，南飞一曲有馀情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":545,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"有感","author":"王松","text":"阅历尘寰又几秋，无端歌哭若羁囚。\n逍遥输与笼中鸟，眠食如何得自由。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":546,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋雨怀人","author":"王松","text":"捲幕祛残暑，苔花绿满庭。\n松烟浮墨海，梧雨滴琴星。\n饮谷猿悬涧，衔芦雁聚汀。\n所思长不见，天际觉鸿冥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":547,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"绝命词","author":"王松","text":"苦海浮沉七十秋，今朝撒手御风游。\n不堪回首尘寰事，万苦千辛一恸休。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":548,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"恭贺东宫庆典","author":"王庆忠","text":"凤辇嫔京不负期，青宫瑞气绕门楣。\n千秋伉俪谐嘉耦，万国君臣献贺仪。\n霭霭定占大吉象，关关合咏好逑诗。\n贮将金屋偿前愿，汉武雄风倍可师。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":549,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏怀","author":"吴荣棣","text":"遥天云雁已沉音，把酒开怀次第斟。\n砥柱作中心匪石，书田无税字皆金。\n地当用武英雄起，树到蟠根岁月深。\n白发依然为故我，何须回首忆青衿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":550,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感时","author":"吴荣棣","text":"晨兴登楼望，神州局已僵。\n中原森虎豹，当道尽豺狼。\n策未三分定，雄称五伯强。\n天心终厌乱，日月见重光。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":551,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"四十书怀 其一","author":"李友泉","text":"虚度光阴四十年，沧桑回首思绵绵。\n功名已付云烟幻，诗酒偏留鸥鹭缘。\n骨傲料难谐浊世，才疏终拟赋归田。\n何时得遂林泉隐，抛去风尘马上鞭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":552,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"四十书怀 其二","author":"李友泉","text":"空教猿鹤守柴门，走马年年滞远村。\n短榻雨惊孤枕梦，疏帘月落一灯昏。\n但凭肝胆循天命，未得涓埃报国恩。\n醉后摩挲书剑在，愧无功业立乾坤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":553,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题大观阁","author":"李种玉","text":"高阁巍峨耸碧霄，云山四面尽来朝。\n如斯福地真难得，好个洞天岂易描。\n文阵雄师呼笔战，词坛健将以旌招。\n眼前八景争题壁，愧我雕龙学未饶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":554,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"讨蕃","author":"周绍祖","text":"野性难驯语未谙，兴师讨伐险途探。\n卫青出塞方征北，诸葛平蛮又入南。\n功纪燕然碑立一，威降铁勒箭传三。\n待看异类齐归化，列作编氓圣泽覃。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":555,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过新竹呈竹社诸君子","author":"林培张","text":"去年两造郑公庐，为续前游一驻车。\n自笑形骸无检束，狂奴故态未曾除。\n老至方知应世难，毁誉任意太无端。\n吾生自有嶙峋骨，未肯随波逐急湍。\n安道偏悭一面缘，王郎仙去亦经年。\n纵云聚散关天定，往事追思便怆然。\n樽前叙旧慰离怀，得暂盘桓亦是佳。\n老景夕阳须护惜，重来有约忍相乖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":556,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"登八卦山拜瞻北白川宫殿下遗碑","author":"林逢春","text":"八卦山头石碣崇，游人到此拜雄风。\n两尊铁炮双峰峙，足记当年战伐功。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":557,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"老妓","author":"林逢春","text":"少小娉婷貌若仙，不堪回首忆当年。\n衰颜已作鸠荼看，旧恨偏多蝶梦牵。\n妆谢金钿无客顾，泪抛玉箸有谁怜。\n懊侬一曲重新唱，无限愁怀落四弦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":558,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"谒台北圣庙","author":"林抟秋","text":"圣宫新杰建，台北焕文光。\n名教纲常地，诗书礼乐场。\n人才多棫朴，俎豆永馨香。\n仰慕尼山学，拜观万仞墙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":559,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]